    "html": "<p>A black-body radiator emits a peak wavelength of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{max}\"></span> and a maximum power of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P_{0}\"></span>. The peak wavelength emitted by a second black-body radiator with the same surface area is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2 \\lambda_{max}\"></span>. What is the total power of the second black-body radiator?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{16}P_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}P_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2P_{0}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16P_{0}\"></span></li></ol>"
